<title>UK: CU gains as bid hopes refuse to die.</title>
<headline>CU gains as bid hopes refuse to die.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British insurance Commercial Union Plc rose on Tuesday as bid speculation continued to swirl around the sector, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 10p at 690 by 0946 GMT, near its year's high of 696p set November 26, in volume of 1.2 million shares.</p>
